---
import YogaLayout from '../../../layouts/YogaLayout.astro';
---
<YogaLayout title="健康経営 | Setsuko Hata Yoga"
  description="就業時間内のハタヨガで、離職・体調不良・生産性を変える健康経営プログラム。導入例・科学的根拠・講師プロフィール。"
  locale="ja"
  active="corporate"
>


  <section class="ja-band ja-band-sage" data-screen-label="Hero" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:var(--color-warm-beige)" data-lt="1">
    <img src="/hatha-yoga/assets/wellness/stretch.jpg" alt="就業時間内のハタヨガクラスで、両腕を広げてポーズをとる社員たち" fetchpriority="high" width="1700" height="874" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:auto" />
    <div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;inset:0;backgrou<nd:linear-gradient(100deg,color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ivory-cream) 88%, transparent) 0%,color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ivory-cream) 55%, transparent) 38%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none"></div>
    
    <div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;top:-160px;right:-70px;width:min(720px,92vw);height:560px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(227,201,160,.26) 0%,rgba(227,201,160,0) 66%);pointer-events:none"></div>
    <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(112px,11vw,138px) clamp(22px,4vw,40px) clamp(104px,10vw,132px)">
      <div style="max-width:620px">
        <h1 class="font-display" style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(34px,5.4vw,60px);line-height:1.18;color:var(--yl-text);word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:normal">職場に、<br />本格ハタヨガを。</h1>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:clamp(24px,3vw,32px)"><a href="#contact" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--color-warm-brown);color:#FFFFFF;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 14px 26px -14px rgba(35,26,16,.8)">体験クラスに申し込む</a><a href="#program" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid rgba(89,96,68,.28);color:var(--yl-text);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap">導入例を見る</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div style="position:relative;z-index:3;max-width:1180px;margin:clamp(-64px,-5vw,-40px) auto 0;padding:0 clamp(22px,4vw,40px)">
    <figure class="sc-rise" style="position:relative;margin:0;max-width:880px;padding:clamp(44px,5vw,62px) clamp(30px,5vw,64px);border:1px solid rgba(138,96,67,.55);border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#FAF6EA 0%,#F0E8D4 52%,var(--color-warm-beige) 100%);box-shadow:0 44px 88px -40px rgba(47,38,32,.55),0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.7) inset">
      <span aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:clamp(18px,3vw,34px);top:-6px;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(84px,10vw,130px);line-height:1;color:rgba(138,96,67,.4)">“</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;inset:9px;border:1px solid rgba(138,96,67,.28);border-radius:10px;pointer-events:none"></span>
      <p class="font-mono" style="position:relative;margin:0;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-warm-brown)">Corporate Wellness</p>
      <blockquote class="font-display" style="position:relative;margin:22px 0 0;font-size:clamp(22px,2.9vw,34px);line-height:1.75;color:var(--yl-text);word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:normal">「離職・体調不良・生産性」を、<br />就業時間内のヨガで変える。</blockquote>
      <figcaption style="position:relative;margin:26px 0 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px">
        <span aria-hidden="true" style="display:block;width:52px;height:1px;background:rgba(138,96,67,.75)"></span>
        <span style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">心と体、そしてエネルギーを整える福利厚生プログラム。</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <section id="issue" class="scroll-mt-24" data-screen-label="課題" style="position:relative;background:var(--color-ivory-cream);overflow:hidden">
    <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 200 320" style="position:absolute;left:-72px;top:70px;width:220px;opacity:.5;transform:rotate(-16deg);pointer-events:none"><path d="M100 12 C 40 90 34 210 100 308 C 166 210 160 90 100 12 Z" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-warm-brown)" stroke-opacity=".32"/><path d="M100 20 L100 300" stroke="var(--color-warm-brown)" stroke-opacity=".25"/><path d="M100 90 C 70 104 58 132 54 160" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-warm-brown)" stroke-opacity=".2"/><path d="M100 90 C 130 104 142 132 146 160" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-warm-brown)" stroke-opacity=".2"/><path d="M100 160 C 74 172 64 196 60 220" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-warm-brown)" stroke-opacity=".18"/><path d="M100 160 C 126 172 136 196 140 220" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-warm-brown)" stroke-opacity=".18"/></svg>
    <div style="position:relative;max-width:72rem;margin:0 auto">
      <div style="display:grid;gap:56px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));align-items:start">
        <div>
          <p class="ja-eyebrow">課題</p>
          <h2 class="font-display" style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,48px);line-height:1.3;color:var(--color-text-primary)">御社に、こんな<br />課題はありませんか？</h2>
          <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:2.05;color:var(--color-text-primary)">特に、繰り返し作業・立ち仕事・座りっぱなしの現場で慢性化しています。</p>
          <figure class="sc-rise" style="margin:40px 0 0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 22px 48px -34px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text-primary) 40%, transparent)">
            <img src="/hatha-yoga/assets/wellness/talk.jpg" alt="企業向けの説明会で話す秦節子" loading="lazy" style="display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px" />
          </figure>
        </div>
        <ol style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
          <li class="sc-rise" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)"><span class="font-display" style="font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:rgba(150,86,44,.55)">01</span><span><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:24px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">離職率が高い</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">採用と育成を繰り返しても人が定着せず、現場が回らない。</span></span></li><li class="sc-rise" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)"><span class="font-display" style="font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:rgba(150,86,44,.55)">02</span><span><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:24px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">生産性の低下</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">疲労・集中力の低下・欠勤が積み重なり、稼働が安定しない。</span></span></li><li class="sc-rise" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)"><span class="font-display" style="font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:rgba(150,86,44,.55)">03</span><span><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:24px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">心身の不調</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">肩こり・腰痛・眼精疲労・ストレスが慢性化している。</span></span></li><li class="sc-rise" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)"><span class="font-display" style="font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:rgba(150,86,44,.55)">04</span><span><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:24px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">運動する時間がない</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">仕事と家事に追われ、社員が体を動かす機会を持てない。</span></span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="cost" class="scroll-mt-24 ja-band ja-band-sand" data-screen-label="コスト" style="position:relative;background:var(--color-warm-beige);overflow:hidden" data-lt="1">
    <div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;right:-170px;top:-130px;width:500px;height:500px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(239,223,196,.22) 0%,rgba(239,223,196,0) 70%);pointer-events:none"></div>
    <div style="position:relative;max-width:72rem;margin:0 auto">
      <p class="ja-eyebrow">見えないコスト</p>
      <h2 class="font-display" style="margin:20px 0 0;max-width:16em;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px);line-height:1.3;color:var(--yl-text)">その課題は、静かに利益を削っています</h2>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px 52px;margin:44px 0 0">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--yl-soft)">01</span><span class="font-display" style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--yl-text)">求人・広告費</span></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--yl-soft)">02</span><span class="font-display" style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--yl-text)">採用プロセス費</span></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--yl-soft)">03</span><span class="font-display" style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--yl-text)">教育・育成費</span></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--yl-soft)">04</span><span class="font-display" style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--yl-text)">生産性の損失</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="font-display sc-rise" style="margin:52px 0 0;max-width:21em;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);line-height:1.62;color:var(--yl-text)">同じ予算を「採用のやり直し」ではなく<em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--yl-soft)">定着</em>に投資すれば、コストは資産に変わります。</p>
      <div style="display:grid;gap:44px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,280px),1fr));margin-top:56px;padding-top:40px;border-top:1px solid rgba(253,247,238,.24)">
        <div>
          <p class="ja-sublabel" style="margin:0">これまで</p>
          <ul style="list-style:none;margin:20px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
            <li><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--yl-text)">再募集の広告費</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:rgba(253,247,238,.75)">人が辞めるたびに発生</span></li><li><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--yl-text)">面接・選考の人件費</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:rgba(253,247,238,.75)">繰り返される採用工数</span></li><li><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--yl-text)">育成のやり直し</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:rgba(253,247,238,.75)">戦力化まで時間とコスト</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="ja-sublabel" style="margin:0">これから</p>
          <ul style="list-style:none;margin:20px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
            <li><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--yl-text)">健康経営としてのヨガ</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:rgba(253,247,238,.75)">社員の健康に直接投資</span></li><li><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--yl-text)">定着率の向上</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:rgba(253,247,238,.75)">離職の連鎖を止める</span></li><li><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--yl-text)">生産性と活気の向上</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:rgba(253,247,238,.75)">元気な職場が利益を生む</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="evidence" class="scroll-mt-24" data-screen-label="科学的根拠" style="position:relative;background:var(--color-ivory-cream);overflow:hidden">
    <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 200 200" style="position:absolute;right:5%;top:44px;width:118px;pointer-events:none;opacity:.42">
      <path d="M100 8 L124 76 L192 100 L124 124 L100 192 L76 124 L8 100 L76 76 Z" fill="none" stroke="#b9975b" stroke-opacity=".85" />
    </svg>
    <div style="position:relative;max-width:72rem;margin:0 auto">
      <div style="display:grid;gap:44px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));align-items:end">
        <div>
          <p class="ja-eyebrow">科学的根拠</p>
          <h2 class="font-display" style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px);line-height:1.3;color:var(--yl-text)">科学が証明する、<br />心と体への変化</h2>
        </div>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:2.05;color:var(--yl-soft)">世界的ヨギ、サドグルが伝授する「インナーエンジニアリング」を対象とした医学研究です。提供するハタヨガは同じ系統にあたります。被験者142名の血液を測定（ハーバード大学の研究者を含むチーム／査読付き医学誌 2020年）。</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;gap:0 40px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));margin-top:56px;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)">
        <div class="sc-rise" style="padding:32px 0"><p class="font-display" style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,54px);line-height:1;color:var(--color-warm-brown)">+70%超</p><p class="font-display" style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">全ての主要な体内物質</p><p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">幸福感に関わるエンドカンナビノイドとBDNFが、実践直後にいずれも70%以上増加（P&lt;0.001）</p></div><div class="sc-rise" style="padding:32px 0"><p class="font-display" style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,54px);line-height:1;color:var(--color-warm-brown)">71%</p><p class="font-display" style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">の人で2-AGが上昇</p><p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">「至福の分子」に関わる2-AGが、被験者の71%で20%以上増加。</p></div><div class="sc-rise" style="padding:32px 0"><p class="font-display" style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,54px);line-height:1;color:var(--color-warm-brown)">53%</p><p class="font-display" style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">の人でBDNFが上昇</p><p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">脳の健康・神経の成長に関わるBDNFが、被験者の53%で20%以上増加。</p></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;gap:0 40px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,200px),1fr));margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)">
        <div class="sc-rise" style="padding:28px 0"><p class="font-display" style="margin:0;font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:var(--color-deep-olive)">-54%</p><p class="font-display" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">働く人のストレス</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--yl-soft)">8週間の実践で54%減少。</p></div><div class="sc-rise" style="padding:28px 0"><p class="font-display" style="margin:0;font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:var(--color-deep-olive)">-46%</p><p class="font-display" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">うつ症状</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--yl-soft)">6週間で平均46%低下。</p></div><div class="sc-rise" style="padding:28px 0"><p class="font-display" style="margin:0;font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:var(--color-deep-olive)">-36%</p><p class="font-display" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">不安</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--yl-soft)">6週間で36%減少。</p></div><div class="sc-rise" style="padding:28px 0"><p class="font-display" style="margin:0;font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:var(--color-deep-olive)">4.8倍</p><p class="font-display" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">回復力（自律神経）</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--yl-soft)">副交感神経の反応が対照群の4.8倍。</p></div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin:24px 0 0;max-width:58em;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(107,87,68,.85)">※ 出典：Sadhasivam et al., Evidence-Based Complementary and Alternative Medicine（2020）, Frontiers in Public Health / Psychiatry / Psychology（2022）, J Ayurveda Integr Med（2012）ほか。6,892名を対象とした大規模調査では、実践者のストレスが31%低いという結果に。わずか21分の実践で深い睡眠と同じ脳波状態に入ることも報告されています。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="effects" class="scroll-mt-24" data-screen-label="効果" style="position:relative;background:var(--color-warm-beige);overflow:hidden">
    <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 320 320" style="position:absolute;right:-56px;bottom:40px;width:min(28vw,250px);pointer-events:none;opacity:.5;transform:rotate(12deg)">
      <path d="M160 12 C 78 96 74 224 160 308 C 246 224 242 96 160 12 Z" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-warm-brown)" stroke-opacity=".38" />
      <path d="M160 52 C 104 118 102 214 160 268 C 218 214 216 118 160 52 Z" fill="none" stroke="#b9975b" stroke-opacity=".34" />
      <path d="M160 12 L160 308" stroke="var(--color-warm-brown)" stroke-opacity=".2" />
    </svg>
    <div style="position:relative;max-width:72rem;margin:0 auto">
      <div style="display:grid;gap:52px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));align-items:center">
        <figure class="sc-rise" style="margin:0">
          <div style="overflow:hidden;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 24px 52px -34px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text-primary) 42%, transparent)">
            <img src="/hatha-yoga/assets/wellness/circle-room.jpg" alt="オフィスの会議室で車座になって瞑想する社員たち" loading="lazy" style="display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px" />
          </div>
        </figure>
        <div>
          <p class="ja-eyebrow">期待できる効果</p>
          <h2 class="font-display" style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,44px);line-height:1.3;color:var(--yl-text)">「本物のハタヨガ」が<br />もたらすもの</h2>
          <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:2.05;color:var(--yl-soft)">「ハ」は太陽、「タ」は月。相反する力の統合を意味します。体を柔らかくするための運動ではなく、エネルギーの次元から心身を整える実践です。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;gap:0 44px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));margin-top:64px">
